ve research and training programs. Specifically, the bill establishes within the Department of the Interior a grant program for projects that improve or conserve...","summarySource":"crs","title":"Wildlife Movement Through Partnerships Act of 2025","type":"hr","url":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/717"},{"bipartisan":true,"cosponsors":18,"crossPartyCosponsors":12,"id":"hr718-119","introducedDate":"2025-01-23","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-02-28","text":"Referred to the Subcommittee on Forestry and Horticulture."},"number":"HR 718","policyArea":"Public Lands and Natural Resources","ranked":true,"stage":"introduced","summary":"Prohibits the Secretaries of the Interior and Agriculture from transferring Federal land to non-Federal entities if the land is publicly accessible or contiguous with publicly accessible land, with specified exceptions for transfers under certain existing statutes.","summarySource":"ai","title":"Public Lands in Public Hands Act","type":"hr","url":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/718"},{"bipartisan":false,"cosponsors":2,"crossPartyCosponsors":0,"id":"hr598-119","introducedDate":"2025-01-21","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-02-28","text":"Referred to the Subcommittee on Forestry and Horticulture."},"number":"HR 598","policyArea":"Public Lands and Natural Resources","ranked":true,"stage":"introduced","summary":"Forest Information Reform Act or the FIR Act This bill specifies that neither the Forest Service nor the Bureau of Land Management are required to reinitiate consultation on a land management plan when a new species is listed as threatened or endangered, critical habitat is designated, or new information reveals effects of the plan may affect a listed species or critical habitat in a manner or to...","summarySource":"crs","title":"FIR Act","type":"hr","url":"https://www.congress.gov/bill/119th-congress/house-bill/598"}],"state":"MT","topCrossPartyCollaborators":[{"bioguideId":"V000136",